## About

I am a Phd student at the Paleo Modelling Group, working on individual contributions of insolation, ice sheet and greenhouse gases of climate variations over the past 3.6 Ma. I used series of equilibrium simulations and mainly focus on global climate variations and Asian summer monsoon changes. 

## Education

- Masters degree in meteorology, climate modelling and environmental sciences 2021-2023, Ecole Nationale de la Meteorologie and University Paul Sabatier, Toulouse, France
- First year of masters degree in ocean, atmosphere and climate physics 2020-2021, Sorbonne Universite, Paris, France
- Undergraduate in Physics 2016-2020, Sorbonne Universite, Paris, France

